  "description": "The 26\" Kent Bayside cruiser bike combines style, function and fun into one attractive package. Equipped with a durable tig-welded steel frame, this bike is built to last and has a classic look. The 7 speed drivetrain features a twist shifter, which provides you with the versatility to conquer a wide variety of terrain with ease. The front and rear caliper brakes ensure you can stop quickly and safely. Smooth cruiser tires give you a comfortable ride, and the front and rear fenders protect you from any splashes. The height adjustable saddle and angle adjustable handlebar allow you to customize your fit, while the handlebar mounted cup holder keeps your drink within reach. This bike is perfect for a leisurely ride along the beach or a casual ride around town.\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
